      "section_title": "1. Choose the correct option (any seven) :",
      "total_marks": 14,
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q1_a",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>The casting method adopted for ornaments and toys of non-ferrous alloys, is</p>",
          "options": [
            "permanent mould casting",
            "slush casting",
            "die casting",
            "centrifugal casting"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_b",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>In a cold chamber die casting machine</p>",
          "options": [
            "melting pot is separate from the machine",
            "melting pot is an integral part of the machine",
            "melting pot may have any location",
            "low temperature and pressure is used"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_c",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Structural sections such as rails, angles, I-beams are made by</p>",
          "options": [
            "hot rolling",
            "hot drawing",
            "hot piercing",
            "hot extrusion"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_d",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Cutting and forming operations can be performed in a single operation in a</p>",
          "options": [
            "simple die",
            "progressive die",
            "compound die",
            "combination die"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_e",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>The teeth of hacksaw blade are bent</p>",
          "options": [
            "towards right",
            "towards left",
            "alternately towards right and left and every third or fourth left straight",
            "may be bent in any direction"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_f",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>A casting defect which occurs near the ingates as rough lumps on the surface of a casting is known as</p>",
