            "scab"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_g",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>The cold chisels are made from</p>",
          "options": [
            "cast iron",
            "mild steel",
            "high-speed steel",
            "cast tool steel"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_h",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>To prevent the body of the blade from jamming in the saw cut, the teeth of blade are</p>",
          "options": [
            "strengthened",
            "sharpened",
            "set",
            "All of the above"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q1_i",
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>A ring gauge is used to</p>",
